        <div style="flex: 1; background: #B7E0E5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); ">
            <h3> <b>Unit 2 - Foundations of AI Programming</b></h3>
            <p style = "font-size: 14pt";>This unit introduces students to programming fundamentals using Python (sequence, selection, iteration, functions), algorithms, and ethical computing, emphasizing human-centered design for inclusive, real-world problem-solving.<br><br> </p>
