        <div style="flex: 1; background: #0093a4; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font-size: 14pt;">
            <h3 style="color: white; margin: 0;"><b>Unit 3 - AI and the Systems That Power It</b></h3>
        
         <p style = "font-size: 14pt; color: white; margin-top: 10px;">This unit explores how AI and computing systems process information and interact with hardware/software, focusing on hands-on design, troubleshooting, analysis of societal/ethical impacts (including bias), and using AI Chat as a learning collaborator.
<br></p>
