    </div>

   
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px;">
        <img src="https://images.code.org/cb30e66a15e83dfaed89254733dde7fc-Screenshot 2025-12-11 at 12.55.01 PM.png" alt="Icon of arrows and code segments" style="width: 20%; max-width: 120px; height: auto;border-radius: 12px;">
