            <h3 style="color: white; margin: 0;"> <b>Unit 4 - The Fabric of the Internet and AI</b></h3>
            <p style = "font-size: 14pt;color: white; margin-top: 10px;">This unit explores the Internet's function (data transmission, addressing, security, protocols), its societal/ethical impacts (like the digital divide), and how AI is used in cybersecurity, preparing students to propose solutions for access and security.<br><br> </p>
