         <p style = "font-size: 14pt;color: white; margin-top: 10px;">This unit teaches students about the dynamic field of cybersecurity, focusing on how AI is transforming both the methods of cyberattacks (like phishing, malware, and denial-of-service) and the strategies used for digital defense (such as anomaly detection and adaptive authentication)
<br></p>
