            <h3 style="color: white; margin: 0;"> <b>Unit 6 - Insights from Data and AI</b></h3>
            <p style = "font-size: 14pt;color: white; margin-top: 10px;">This unit introduces students to data science concepts, guiding them through developing data questions, using spreadsheets for analysis, practicing ethical data management, and communicating their findings using visualization to tell a compelling data story.<br><br> </p>
